<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51400" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴτριον</span></b>  (on the accent v.
			Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
			1.357
		</span></i>, al.), τό, a kind of <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cake</i> (
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεμμάτιον λεπτὸν διὰ σησάμου καὶ
					μέλιτος γινόμενον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ath.
					14.646d
				</span></i>
			, but cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλακοῦντες, σησαμοῦντες, ἴτρια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ach.</u>
					1092
				</span></i>
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μελιτώμασι καὶ ἰτρίοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					4.63
				</span></i>
			), <i><span class="en">
				Anacr.
				17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Acut.</u>
			</span></i>(<u>Sp.</u>)<i><span class="en">
				72
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Anon.Lond.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				2.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				736.50
			</span></i>: freq. in pl., <i><span class="en">
				Sol.
				38
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				199
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Archipp.
				9
			</span></i>, prob. in <i><span class="en">
				Herod.
				3.44
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴτρια, τραγήμαθ᾽ ἧκε, πυραμοῦς, ἄμης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ephipp.
					8.3
				</span></i>
			; later, of any cake, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴτρια καρποῦ πεποιημένα πυρίνου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					1.55
				</span></i>
			; of the Roman <i>libum</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλακοῦς ἐκ γάλακτος ἰτρίων καὶ
					μέλιτος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ath.
					3.125f
				</span></i>
			.</div>
